# Developer handoff location

Developer-handoff PDFs for this project are **not** stored only inside the ChamberQ repo.

Canonical folder (outside the project):

`/Users/chowdhuryjoy/developer-handoff/ChamberQ/`

## Filename (required)

Stamp is **day+month**, then **24-hour time**, no year and no colon.

Pattern:

`<Name>-DDMM-HHmm.pdf`

Examples:

- `ChamberQ-Developer-Handoff-1308-2200.pdf` — 13 August, 10:00 PM
- `ChamberQ-Developer-Handoff-1308-0326.pdf` — 13 August, 3:26 AM

Use local time at save (`date +"%d%m-%H%M"`). Do not use AM/PM. Do not include the year.

A new save is a **new file**. Do not overwrite an older stamped PDF.

## Rule

Whenever you generate, export, or update a **developer handoff PDF** (or its HTML source):

1. Save the file in `/Users/chowdhuryjoy/developer-handoff/ChamberQ/` with the stamped filename above
2. You may also keep a copy under `docs/` in the repo if the source still lives there
3. Do not create a new handoff-only folder inside the project

Other projects get their own named folder under `/Users/chowdhuryjoy/developer-handoff/` — never mix PDFs at the root of that folder.
